    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T06:54:43Z",
    "body": "Seen again on a Windows quick gate of main `fd7ad703d` (Intel CPU + Intel graphics box, run over SSH): `trace_composite` and `trace_parity` both exit `0xC0000005` (access violation) after 5-6 s; every other step of 1,196 passed. The same two suites pass on main `a6cd476fd` on a second Windows box (AMD Ryzen + Radeon). Fits this issue (a GPU device made per test with no lock), not a regression from the merges in that range.",
